  "solution": "**Given:**\n\n4 - 3 of (1(1)/(2) + (1)/(3) div (1)/(2) of 4-(1)/(4))\n\n**Concept used:**\n\n [IMAGE: https://cdn.repeatermock.com/tb/c7a9b9173e89d44a854cc9c8053cf1e4425472078909d5687a2dfa61a2ec670c.png] \n\n**Calculation:**\n\n4 - 3 of (1(1)/(2) + (1)/(3) div (1)/(2) of 4-(1)/(4))\n\n⇒ 4 - 3 of ((3)/(2) + (1)/(3) div (1)/(2)times 4-(1)/(4))\n\n⇒ 4 - 3 of ((3)/(2) + (1)/(3) div 2-(1)/(4))\n\n⇒ 4 - 3 of ((3)/(2) + (1)/(6)-(1)/(4))\n\n⇒ 4 - 3 of ((18 + 2-3)/(12))\n\n⇒ 4 - 17/4\n\n⇒ (16 - 17)/4\n\n⇒ - 1/4\n\n**∴ Required answer is - 1/4**",
